{"success": true, "message": "Test details sent successfully", "data": {"test": {"_id": "69de21fd7e39d99b57bc5bd0", "analysisVideoCdn": "yt", "exam": ["605dfcb2f226ac25a8bd5fef"], "ctype": null, "position": 0, "order": 12, "enableCalculator": false, "isContinuousQuestion": false, "reattemptAvailable": false, "singleSectionMultipleSubjects": false, "timeRestricted": false, "title": "Probability - Test 1", "description": "Previous Year Questions as Chapter Test", "syllabus": "This test contains questions from all topics of this chapter included in the JEE Main syllabus. It includes a mix of questions from PYQs of JEE Main 2019 - 2025.", "totalTime": 75, "totalQuestions": 25, "totalMarks": 100, "bonusQuestions": null, "bonusMarks": null, "startDate": "2026-04-15T03:30:00.000Z", "endDate": "2027-04-30T00:00:00.000Z", "type": "free", "class": "605df635a37b7025c438d685", "instruction": "608289ffb160b022e9442c83", "subjects": [{"subjectId": "607018ee404ae53194e73d92", "totalMarks": 100, "bonusMarks": 0, "totalQuestions": 25, "bonusQuestions": 0, "_id": "69de4f402ee0e063d925afdb"}], "sections": [{"sectionId": {"_id": "69de4f402ee0e063d925aef6", "title": "Mathematics Single Correct", "sectionType": "normal", "subject": "607018ee404ae53194e73d92", "questions": [{"_id": "69de4f402ee0e063d925adf1", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60c9e849ea076dc381c0df9c"], "topics": ["60e2fb3c66f9ce3f243b4d5a"], "concepts": ["60e2fb3c66f9ce3f243b4d2a"], "question": {"text": "<p>Two fair dice are thrown. The numbers on them are taken as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;and a system of linear equations<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />is constructed. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math> is the probability that the system has a unique solution and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math> is the probability that the system has no solution, then:</p>"}, "options": [{"id": "0bc8bb", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f402ee0e063d925adf2"}, {"id": "cef881", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f402ee0e063d925adf3"}, {"id": "2defcd", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f402ee0e063d925adf4"}, {"id": "e4cf21", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f402ee0e063d925adf5"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f402ee0e063d925adf6", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60c9e849ea076dc381c0df9c"], "topics": ["60e2faac66f9ce3f243b454e"], "concepts": ["60e2fbc066f9ce